OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for 'violent and
OL,4,Adangerous' stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old man has been jailed for
OL,7,F11 years after he stabbed another man
OL,8,Fin the chest, leaving him with
OL,9,Flife-threatening injuries.
OL,11,FAlan Kelly, from Lutterworth Close,
OL,12,FNorthampton, was found guilty of
OL,13,Fattempted murder after a "violent and
OL,14,Fdangerous attack" in the town on 5
OL,15,FFebruary 2025, police said.
OL,17,FThe knife went through the other man's
OL,18,Fright lung and grazed his heart and
OL,19,Fafter an "extensive period in hospital"
OL,20,Fhe made a full recovery, the force
OL,21,Fadded.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
